7.13.m:
Vyāsa said:
Having spoken thus, the Lord of the universe vanished right there, O brahmin;
that brahmin also, having achieved his purpose, went to his own house.

7.17.m:
Dānta said:
“Listen, O vipra! I shall tell you the hundred and eight names,
having extracted the essence of the thousand names of Viṣṇu, the supreme soul;
